# (AI-assisted) moving platform test: the Volcanic Crater minecarts (village3). Jak is put on the
# load of the nearest minecartsteel (pad script "teleport"), and "jpos" logs the cart's joint 4, how
# many riders the cart found, and Jak, every 10 frames. Format: game/sce/pad_script.h
#   grep -a "pad script" stdout.log
# Riding works when Jak stays about 1.2 m above the cart's joint with "riders 1" for the whole log
# (the rail loop takes 30 s). Before the fix of add-rider! (C backend ABI) the cart found Jak
# ("riders 1") but never carried him: he stayed behind and fell into the lava.
# The first teleport triggers a camera fly-by (village-cam, pov-camera) that grabs Jak for about
# 7 s (target-grab); the second one, after it, runs with Jak in target-stance.
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
100 continue village3-warp
101 wait *target* target-continue
102 wait *target* target-stance
103 pos *target*
400 wait *target* target-stance
401 jpos minecartsteel 4
402 teleport minecartsteel 4 2
403 jpos minecartsteel 4
413 jpos minecartsteel 4
423 jpos minecartsteel 4
433 jpos minecartsteel 4
443 jpos minecartsteel 4
453 jpos minecartsteel 4
463 jpos minecartsteel 4
